{"3885060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Homecoming Forest", "steam_appid": 3885060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer this land with your courage and wisdom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fiadh and her mother lived peacefully in the Magic Forest. One day, her mother ventured to the Sealed Mountain to investigate strange disturbances but never returned. Now, Fiadh must embark on her own journey to uncover the truth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Forest Homecoming</strong></i> is a classic-style 2D action-adventure game set in a vast world. Explore the magical forest, desolate deserts, and perilous underground kingdoms. Battle creatures corrupted by dark magic, meet friendly creatures who have their own goals, and delve into the secrets of the Sealed Mountain to ultimately save the forest's inhabitants!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/5f2025ef8a41be2037622d19bbeac24c.poster.avif?t=1755933786\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/5f2025ef8a41be2037622d19bbeac24c.webm?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/5f2025ef8a41be2037622d19bbeac24c.mp4?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>**Game Features**</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Classic side-scrolling</strong></i> levels with a unique artistic style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Smooth 2D controls:</strong></i> Dodge attacks and use magical abilities to defeat foes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/e0ca794e254093286b4b3773defd50e5.poster.avif?t=1755933786\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/e0ca794e254093286b4b3773defd50e5.webm?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/e0ca794e254093286b4b3773defd50e5.mp4?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Explore a vast</strong></i>, interconnected world: Travel through lush forests, barren deserts, and mysterious underworlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Shape your own adventure!</i></strong> The Magic Forest is an expansive world where you can choose your path and challenges.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/a24c7dea82fed1ebff23cfbb0eba5378.poster.avif?t=1755933786\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/a24c7dea82fed1ebff23cfbb0eba5378.webm?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/a24c7dea82fed1ebff23cfbb0eba5378.mp4?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Master new abilities!</i></strong> Befriend creatures, learn magic, and enhance your strength and speed. Leap to new heights, sprint with agility, and unleash magical blasts upon your enemies!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/037c8200a4a2eacc09193ecc96de457b.poster.avif?t=1755933786\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/037c8200a4a2eacc09193ecc96de457b.webm?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/037c8200a4a2eacc09193ecc96de457b.mp4?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><i>Equip powerful items!</i></strong> These treasures can give you unique abilities. Choose your favorites and start your journey!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/44cadcd54f9778aa92fed91abdd8396d.poster.avif?t=1755933786\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/44cadcd54f9778aa92fed91abdd8396d.webm?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/44cadcd54f9778aa92fed91abdd8396d.mp4?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Vibrant 2D animation</i></strong> brings life to cute characters, but be careful—they may pack a punch!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/275f0a9b6f732fbdb95ee174e2de6015.poster.avif?t=1755933786\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/275f0a9b6f732fbdb95ee174e2de6015.webm?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/275f0a9b6f732fbdb95ee174e2de6015.mp4?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a wonderfully handcrafted world!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every region is marvelous and special, filled with new creatures and characters to encounter. Marvel at the scenery while discovering hidden worlds beneath familiar paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like classic gameplay, charming yet combative characters, unknown adventures, and beautiful 2D landscapes—Forest Homecoming awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer this land with your courage and wisdom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fiadh and her mother lived peacefully in the Magic Forest. One day, her mother ventured to the Sealed Mountain to investigate strange disturbances but never returned. Now, Fiadh must embark on her own journey to uncover the truth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Forest Homecoming</strong></i> is a classic-style 2D action-adventure game set in a vast world. Explore the magical forest, desolate deserts, and perilous underground kingdoms. Battle creatures corrupted by dark magic, meet friendly creatures who have their own goals, and delve into the secrets of the Sealed Mountain to ultimately save the forest's inhabitants!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/5f2025ef8a41be2037622d19bbeac24c.poster.avif?t=1755933786\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/5f2025ef8a41be2037622d19bbeac24c.webm?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/5f2025ef8a41be2037622d19bbeac24c.mp4?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>**Game Features**</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Classic side-scrolling</strong></i> levels with a unique artistic style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Smooth 2D controls:</strong></i> Dodge attacks and use magical abilities to defeat foes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/e0ca794e254093286b4b3773defd50e5.poster.avif?t=1755933786\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/e0ca794e254093286b4b3773defd50e5.webm?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/e0ca794e254093286b4b3773defd50e5.mp4?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Explore a vast</strong></i>, interconnected world: Travel through lush forests, barren deserts, and mysterious underworlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Shape your own adventure!</i></strong> The Magic Forest is an expansive world where you can choose your path and challenges.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/a24c7dea82fed1ebff23cfbb0eba5378.poster.avif?t=1755933786\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/a24c7dea82fed1ebff23cfbb0eba5378.webm?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/a24c7dea82fed1ebff23cfbb0eba5378.mp4?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Master new abilities!</i></strong> Befriend creatures, learn magic, and enhance your strength and speed. Leap to new heights, sprint with agility, and unleash magical blasts upon your enemies!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/037c8200a4a2eacc09193ecc96de457b.poster.avif?t=1755933786\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/037c8200a4a2eacc09193ecc96de457b.webm?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/037c8200a4a2eacc09193ecc96de457b.mp4?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><i>Equip powerful items!</i></strong> These treasures can give you unique abilities. Choose your favorites and start your journey!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/44cadcd54f9778aa92fed91abdd8396d.poster.avif?t=1755933786\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/44cadcd54f9778aa92fed91abdd8396d.webm?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/44cadcd54f9778aa92fed91abdd8396d.mp4?t=1755933786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Vibrant 2D animation</i></strong> brings life to cute characters, but be careful—they may pack a punch!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885060/extras/275f0a9b6f732fbdb95ee174e2de6015.poster.avif?t=1755933786\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst